{"content":[{"c":["HARIPH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Ancestor of a family who returned to Jerusalem with Zerubbabel after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.7.24","r":"Neh.7.24","rawR":"Neh.7.24","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.7.24","value":"Neh.7.24"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 7:24"},"). The name Jorah appears in the parallel list of ",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.2.18","r":"Ezra.2.18","rawR":"Ezra.2.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.2.18","value":"Ezra.2.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezra 2:18"},". A representative of this family signed Ezra’s covenant of faithfulness to God with Nehemiah and others (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.10.19","r":"Neh.10.19","rawR":"Neh.10.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.10.19","value":"Neh.10.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 10:19"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Hariph","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Neh 7:24","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.7.24","rawQueryValue":"Neh.7.24","sourceRefExact":"Neh.7.24"},{"anchorText":"Ezra 2:18","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.2.18","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.2.18","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.2.18"},{"anchorText":"Neh 10:19","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.10.19","rawQueryValue":"Neh.10.19","sourceRefExact":"Neh.10.19"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"e30c21b49876f32f6a5a94869d1112f1c5530c49f0cc97355f2df5cb89cd5df5","sourceItemName":"Hariph","sourceItemOrder":118,"sourceMember":"Articles/H.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Hariph","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Hariph","title":"Hariph","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}